---
title: "initialize (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_key: validate ECIES publicKey point(x, y)
    q_validate_key --> q_validate_timing: point on curve
    q_validate_key --> q_revert_key: InvalidECIESKey
    q_validate_timing --> q_validate_addresses: startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
    q_validate_timing --> q_revert_timing: timing sequence invalid
    q_validate_addresses --> q_validate_fees: bidToken, askToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry valid
    q_validate_addresses --> q_revert_addr: invalid addresses
    q_validate_fees --> q_set_config: fee basis points valid
    q_validate_fees --> q_revert_fees: invalid fees
    q_set_config --> q_set_key: publicKey = _publicKey, minimumInvestAmount = _minimumInvestAmount
    q_set_key --> q_init_state: cancelLocked = false
    q_init_state --> q_emit: startTime, endTime, refundEndTime, bidToken, askToken, projectAdmin = params
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Initialized
    q_revert_key --> [*]: revert InvalidECIESKey
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert InvalidTimingSequence
    q_revert_addr --> [*]: revert InvalidAddress
    q_revert_fees --> [*]: revert InvalidFeeConfiguration

    note right of q_set_config
        INV-001: publicKey must be a valid point on the ECIES curve
        INV-002: startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
        INV-003: cancelLocked initialized to false
        INV-004: privateKey is not set during initialization
    end note
